#. TRANSLATORS: boot message: the SD card's data partition (games, saves)
msgid "The data partition could not be restored. Your games and saves may need to be copied again."
msgstr "Partisi data tidak bisa dipulihkan. Game dan save game kamu mungkin perlu disalin lagi."

msgid "The data partition was unreadable and was reformatted."
msgstr "Partisi data tidak terbaca dan sudah diformat ulang."

